&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;alff2y&quot; data-start=&quot;1228&quot; data-end=&quot;1432&quot;&gt;Oversee trade surveillance and market abuse initiatives, optimising detection scenarios, controls, and monitoring capabilities using data-driven insights and responsible AI techniques where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vrap1p&quot; data-start=&quot;1433&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;Advise senior stakeholders on regulatory expectations and translate complex requirements into practical, strategic solutions that improve enterprise risk management and operational resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1432iz5&quot; data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1844&quot;&gt;Apply and oversee AI-enabled analytics and model tuning techniques to enhance risk monitoring, alert calibration, and false positive reduction while ensuring appropriate governance, validation, and human oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vrvr0p&quot; data-start=&quot;1845&quot; data-end=&quot;2057&quot;&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders while contributing to business development, proposition development, capability growth, and thought leadership across the Non-Financial Risk practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2059&quot; data-end=&quot;2085&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2059&quot; data-end=&quot;2085&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
