&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19ksrtw&quot; data-start=&quot;2087&quot; data-end=&quot;2218&quot;&gt;Extensive experience delivering enterprise or operational risk transformation within financial services or management consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;so056w&quot; data-start=&quot;2219&quot; data-end=&quot;2357&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of market abuse regulation, trade surveillance frameworks, operational risk, and wider financial crime risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j9zfyo&quot; data-start=&quot;2358&quot; data-end=&quot;2528&quot;&gt;Experience working with AI, machine learning, or advanced analytics within risk or surveillance environments, including model optimisation and responsible AI practices.&lt;/li&gt;
