&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n7iw2t&quot; data-start=&quot;2683&quot; data-end=&quot;2854&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, leadership, and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to translate complex risk challenges into practical, business-focused solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
