&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1hl1yo8&quot; data-start=&quot;773&quot; data-end=&quot;788&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;776&quot; data-end=&quot;788&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;790&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;Join Capco&#39;s Data Strategy &amp;amp; Advisory team as a Manager or Senior Manager, shaping enterprise-level AI and data strategies for the world&#39;s leading financial institutions. This is a high-impact role for strategic thinkers passionate about the intersection of data, AI and business value. You will guide clients in envisioning and realising AI-driven competitive advantage—beyond tooling and beyond pipelines—while helping organisations adopt AI-enabled ways of working responsibly, balancing innovation with governance, human judgement and measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
