&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15v2o2b&quot; data-start=&quot;2012&quot; data-end=&quot;2266&quot;&gt;Facilitate executive workshops, visioning sessions and strategic decision-making, developing compelling board-level narratives and investment cases while using AI-enabled insights and approved AI tools to enhance analysis and strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1l2zye8&quot; data-start=&quot;2267&quot; data-end=&quot;2479&quot;&gt;Collaborate across Capco&#39;s Engineering, Architecture, Risk, Product, Innovation and Data teams to ensure strategic recommendations are actionable, commercially viable and aligned with responsible AI principles.&lt;/li&gt;
